/** @mainpage ZohoInvoiceDataProvider Module

    @tableofcontents

    @section zohoinvoicedataproviderintro ZohoInvoiceDataProvider Introduction

    The %ZohoInvoiceDataProvider module provides a data provider API for Zoho Invoice
    invoicing and billing through the Zoho Invoice REST API.

    To use this module, use \c "%requires ZohoInvoiceDataProvider" in your code.

    All the public symbols in the module are defined in the ZohoInvoiceDataProvider namespace.

    The main classes are:
    - @ref ZohoInvoiceDataProvider::ZohoInvoiceDataProvider "ZohoInvoiceDataProvider":
      the root data provider for Zoho Invoice with child providers for invoices, contacts, estimates, etc.

    @par Example:
    @code{.py}
#!/usr/bin/env qore

%new-style
%strict-args
%require-types
%enable-all-warnings

%requires ZohoInvoiceDataProvider
%requires ZohoInvoiceRestClient

# Create a REST client with credentials
ZohoInvoiceRestClient rest({
    "oauth2_client_id": ENV.ZOHOINVOICE_CLIENT_ID,
    "oauth2_client_secret": ENV.ZOHOINVOICE_CLIENT_SECRET,
    "oauth2_refresh_token": ENV.ZOHOINVOICE_REFRESH_TOKEN,
    "organization_id": ENV.ZOHOINVOICE_ORGANIZATION_ID,
    "subdomain": "zoho",
    "domain": ".com",
});

# Create a data provider from the REST client
ZohoInvoiceDataProvider zoho(rest);

# List invoices
map printf("Invoice: %s - %s\n", $1.invoice_number, $1.total),
    zoho.getChildProvider("invoices").searchRecords();
    @endcode

    @section zohoinvoicedataproviderrelnotes Release Notes

    @subsection zohoinvoicedataproviderv1_0 ZohoInvoiceDataProvider v1.0
    - the initial version of the %ZohoInvoiceDataProvider module
*/

#! Contains all public definitions in the ZohoInvoiceDataProvider module
public namespace ZohoInvoiceDataProvider {
}
